        "ring_assemblies": "Preferred-name selection for ring assemblies is treated in P-52.2.7.",
        "derived_substituent_groups": "Selection of preferred names is also needed for substituent groups derived from parent hydrides.",
        "saturation": "The hydro/dehydro prefixes and ene/yne endings express the level of saturation."
